  "prefLabel": "Plc 1303.02 Meetings and Records of Advisory Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1303.02 Meetings and Records of Advisory Board.\n\n(a) The advisory board shall meet at the call of the executive director.\n\n(b) Meetings of the advisory board shall be held at the OPLC’s offices in Concord, NH, or in such other location as the executive director determines will be most convenient for the largest number of anticipated attendees.\n\n(c) Notice of meetings shall be provided as required by RSA 91-A.\n\n(d) Records of the advisory board shall be maintained by the OPLC as required by RSA 91-A.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1300.html"
